  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n18.01 × 3.99 + 9.99 × 3.99\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 18.01 × 3.99 + 9.99 × 3.99\n\n⇒ (18 + 0.01) × (4 – 0.01) + (10 – 0.01) × (4 – 0.01)\n\n⇒ 72 – 0.18 + 0.04 – 0.0001 + 40 – 0.1 – 0.04 + 0.0001\n\n⇒ 112 – 0.18 – 0.1\n\n⇒ 112 – 0.28 = 111.72 approx 112\n\n**Therefore, the value in place of question mark should be 112.**",
